      "v4_semantics": "In v2 Goal6/reset0, RTC lifts repeatedly occurred near the rack rather than transporting the bottle to the requested bowl. Frames at steps100/130/160/205 and recorded reviews show this. Add a semantic candidate family when the destination/subgoal is clear but a numeric world-coordinate correction is not. All candidates still need a clear predicted win against one fixed native proposal; only executed observed-useful commands train. This is a prospective alternative, not a success claim.",
